I’m looking into object property keys, which could be strings, symbols, or maybe computed. Methods include shorthand, function properties, and the caveats with arrow functions and this. I also want to explore dynamic keys, method definitions, and handling immutability with techniques like the spread operator. Finally, I’ll touch on Object.hasOwn() and the distinction between object properties and prototypes.

