4. Set 在 LabPilot 中的典型用法

4.1 去重 metric names

type ExperimentRun = {
  readonly id: string;
  readonly experimentId: string;
  status: "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";
  metrics: Record<string, number>;
  startedAt: string;
};

function getUniqueMetricNames(runs: ExperimentRun[]): string[] {
  const metricNames = runs.flatMap((run) => {
    return Object.keys(run.metrics);
  });

  return [...new Set(metricNames)];
}

示例输入：

const runs: ExperimentRun[] = [
  {
    id: "run_001",
    experimentId: "exp_001",
    status: "finished",
    metrics: {
      accuracy: 0.91,
      loss: 0.23,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
  },
  {
    id: "run_002",
    experimentId: "exp_001",
    status: "finished",
    metrics: {
      accuracy: 0.88,
      f1: 0.82,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T11:00:00.000Z",
  },
];

输出：

["accuracy", "loss", "f1"]

4.2 去重 experiment tags

type Experiment = {
  readonly id: string;
  readonly projectId: string;
  name: string;
  tags: string[];
};

function getUniqueExperimentTags(experiments: Experiment[]): string[] {
  const tags = experiments.flatMap((experiment) => {
    return experiment.tags;
  });

  return [...new Set(tags)];
}

如果想排序：

function getSortedUniqueExperimentTags(experiments: Experiment[]): string[] {
  return [...new Set(
    experiments.flatMap((experiment) => experiment.tags),
  )].sort((a, b) => a.localeCompare(b));
}

4.3 判断 runId 是否重复

function hasDuplicateRunId(runs: ExperimentRun[]): boolean {
  const seenIds = new Set<string>();

  for (const run of runs) {
    if (seenIds.has(run.id)) {
      return true;
    }

    seenIds.add(run.id);
  }

  return false;
}

这里用 Set 的原因：

我们只关心某个 id 是否已经出现过。
Set.has(id) 正好表达这个语义。

也可以用 some：

function hasDuplicateRunId(runs: ExperimentRun[]): boolean {
  const seenIds = new Set<string>();

  return runs.some((run) => {
    if (seenIds.has(run.id)) {
      return true;
    }

    seenIds.add(run.id);
    return false;
  });
}

4.4 找出重复 runIds

function findDuplicateRunIds(runs: ExperimentRun[]): string[] {
  const seenIds = new Set<string>();
  const duplicateIds = new Set<string>();

  for (const run of runs) {
    if (seenIds.has(run.id)) {
      duplicateIds.add(run.id);
    } else {
      seenIds.add(run.id);
    }
  }

  return [...duplicateIds];
}

为什么 duplicateIds 也用 Set？

同一个重复 id 可能出现很多次。
duplicateIds 用 Set 可以避免重复记录。

4.5 用 Set 判断筛选条件

假设用户选择了多个状态：

const selectedStatuses = new Set<RunStatus>(["finished", "failed"]);

筛选：

function filterRunsByStatuses(
  runs: ExperimentRun[],
  selectedStatuses: Set<RunStatus>,
): ExperimentRun[] {
  return runs.filter((run) => {
    return selectedStatuses.has(run.status);
  });
}

这比写一堆 || 更适合动态筛选：

run.status === "finished" || run.status === "failed"

当筛选条件来自 UI 多选框时，Set 很自然。

