更适合批量查找。

7.4 Map 管理 Agent tools

type ToolExecutor = (args: unknown) => unknown;

class ToolRegistryService {
  private readonly tools = new Map<string, ToolExecutor>();

  register(toolName: string, executor: ToolExecutor): void {
    if (this.tools.has(toolName)) {
      throw new Error(`Tool already registered: ${toolName}`);
    }

    this.tools.set(toolName, executor);
  }

  call(toolName: string, args: unknown): unknown {
    const executor = this.tools.get(toolName);

    if (executor === undefined) {
      throw new Error(`Unknown tool: ${toolName}`);
    }

    return executor(args);
  }

  listToolNames(): string[] {
    return [...this.tools.keys()];
  }
}

这里 Map 很合适，因为：

工具名是 key。
执行器是 value。
需要 set / get / has / delete。

