11. 按 metricName 分组 MetricRow

前面你已经学过把 runs 展开成 metric rows：

type MetricRow = {
  runId: string;
  experimentId: string;
  metricName: string;
  value: number;
};

function createMetricRows(runs: ExperimentRun[]): MetricRow[] {
  return runs.flatMap((run) => {
    return Object.entries(run.metrics).map(([metricName, value]) => {
      return {
        runId: run.id,
        experimentId: run.experimentId,
        metricName,
        value,
      };
    });
  });
}

现在可以按 metricName 分组：

function groupMetricRowsByName(
  rows: MetricRow[],
): Record<string, MetricRow[]> {
  return rows.reduce<Record<string, MetricRow[]>>(
    (groups, row) => {
      const group = groups[row.metricName];

      if (group === undefined) {
        groups[row.metricName] = [row];
      } else {
        group.push(row);
      }

      return groups;
    },
    {},
  );
}

使用：

const metricRows = createMetricRows(runs);
const rowsByMetricName = groupMetricRowsByName(metricRows);

输出类似：

{
  accuracy: [
    { runId: "run_001", metricName: "accuracy", value: 0.91 },
    { runId: "run_002", metricName: "accuracy", value: 0.88 },
  ],
  loss: [
    { runId: "run_001", metricName: "loss", value: 0.23 },
  ],
}

这适合：

每个 metric 单独画一条曲线
每个 metric 单独统计均值
