8.3 加载 Agent Summary：retry + timeout

async function loadAgentSummaryOrNull(
  workspaceId: string,
): Promise<AgentSummary | null> {
  try {
    return await retry(
      () => {
        return withTimeout(
          fetchAgentSummary(workspaceId),
          2000,
        );
      },
      {
        retries: 2,
        delayMs: 500,
        backoffFactor: 2,
        maxDelayMs: 2000,
        shouldRetry: (error) => {
          const message = getErrorMessage(error);

          return (
            message.includes("temporarily") ||
            message.includes("timed out")
          );
        },
        onRetry: (error, attempt, delayMs) => {
          console.warn(
            `retry agent summary ${attempt} in ${delayMs}ms:`,
            getErrorMessage(error),
          );
        },
      },
    );
  } catch (error) {
    console.warn(
      "agent summary degraded:",
      getErrorMessage(error),
    );

    return null;
  }
}

这个函数的语义：

Agent summary 是增强模块。
可以 timeout。
可以 retry。
最终失败后返回 null，不影响主页面。

8.4 加载非核心面板：Promise.allSettled

function fulfilledValueOrDefault<T>(
  result: PromiseSettledResult<T>,
  defaultValue: T,
  warnings: string[],
): T {
  if (result.status === "fulfilled") {
    return result.value;
  }

  warnings.push(getErrorMessage(result.reason));

  return defaultValue;
}

export async function loadAgentPanelData(
  workspaceId: string,
): Promise<AgentPanelData> {
  const [
    summaryResult,
    recommendedPapersResult,
    activityItemsResult,
  ] = await Promise.allSettled([
    loadAgentSummaryOrNull(workspaceId),
    fetchRecommendedPapers(workspaceId),
    fetchActivityItems(workspaceId),
  ]);

  const warnings: string[] = [];

  const summary = fulfilledValueOrDefault<AgentSummary | null>(
    summaryResult,
    null,
    warnings,
  );

  const recommendedPapers = fulfilledValueOrDefault<Paper[]>(
    recommendedPapersResult,
    [],
    warnings,
  );

  const activityItems = fulfilledValueOrDefault<ActivityItem[]>(
    activityItemsResult,
    [],
    warnings,
  );

  return {
    summary,
    recommendedPapers,
    activityItems,
    warnings,
  };
}

这里用 Promise.allSettled，因为：

summary / recommendedPapers / activityItems 都是增强模块。
某个失败时，其他成功结果仍然有价值。

8.5 加载完整 Workspace 页面：核心数据 + 非核心数据

export async function loadWorkspacePageData(
  workspaceId: string,
): Promise<WorkspacePageData> {
  const workspaceData = await loadWorkspaceData(workspaceId);

  const [runDashboardData, agentPanelData] = await Promise.all([
    Promise.resolve(createRunDashboardData(workspaceData.runs)),
    loadAgentPanelData(workspaceId),
  ]);

  return {
    workspaceData,
    runDashboardData,
    agentPanelData,
  };
}

这里有个细节：

Promise.resolve(createRunDashboardData(workspaceData.runs))

其实这个同步计算不需要并发 Promise 包装。更简单也可以写：

const runDashboardData = createRunDashboardData(workspaceData.runs);

const agentPanelData = await loadAgentPanelData(workspaceId);

更推荐的清晰版本是：

export async function loadWorkspacePageData(
  workspaceId: string,
): Promise<WorkspacePageData> {
  const workspaceData = await loadWorkspaceData(workspaceId);

  const runDashboardData = createRunDashboardData(workspaceData.runs);

  const agentPanelData = await loadAgentPanelData(workspaceId);

  return {
    workspaceData,
    runDashboardData,
    agentPanelData,
  };
}

这个版本更适合学习阶段。

为什么？

createRunDashboardData 是同步计算。
不要为了并发而强行 Promise 化。

所以最终推荐写法：

export async function loadWorkspacePageData(
  workspaceId: string,
): Promise<WorkspacePageData> {
  const workspaceData = await loadWorkspaceData(workspaceId);

  const runDashboardData = createRunDashboardData(
    workspaceData.runs,
  );

  const agentPanelData = await loadAgentPanelData(workspaceId);

  return {
    workspaceData,
    runDashboardData,
    agentPanelData,
  };
}

