练习 3：增加批量加载 runs

要求：

输入 runIds。
并发加载 run。
允许部分失败。
返回成功 runs 和错误 messages。

你可以自己扩展一个：

fetchRunById(runId: string): Promise<ExperimentRun>

然后实现：

export async function loadRunsByIdsSettled(
  runIds: string[],
): Promise<{
  runs: ExperimentRun[];
  errors: string[];
}> {
  const results = await Promise.allSettled(
    runIds.map((runId) => {
      return fetchRunById(runId);
    }),
  );

  const runs = results.flatMap((result) => {
    if (result.status === "fulfilled") {
      return [result.value];
    }

    return [];
  });

  const errors = results.flatMap((result) => {
    if (result.status === "rejected") {
      return [getErrorMessage(result.reason)];
    }

    return [];
  });

  return {
    runs,
    errors,
  };
}

练习 4：增加实验状态轮询

要求：

每隔 2 秒查询一次实验状态。
如果 finished / failed，就返回最终状态。
最多查询 10 次。
超过 10 次抛出 timeout 错误。

提示：

type ExperimentStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

type ExperimentState = {
  experimentId: string;
  status: ExperimentStatus;
};

参考结构：

export async function waitForExperimentFinished(
  experimentId: string,
): Promise<ExperimentState> {
  const maxAttempts = 10;

  for (let attempt = 1; attempt <= maxAttempts; attempt += 1) {
    const state = await fetchExperimentState(experimentId);

    if (state.status === "finished" || state.status === "failed") {
      return state;
    }

    await sleep(2000);
  }

  throw new Error(
    `Experiment ${experimentId} did not finish after ${maxAttempts} attempts`,
  );
}

