25.1 函数边界显式

推荐：

export function formatAccuracy(accuracy: number): string {
  return `${(accuracy * 100).toFixed(2)}%`;
}

25.2 局部变量推断

推荐：

const totalRuns = runs.length;

const failedRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
  return run.status === "failed";
