8. 第四步：定义 RunStatus 和 ExperimentRun

文件：

src/labpilot-types/run.ts

写入：

// src/labpilot-types/run.ts

import type { ExperimentId } from "./experiment.js";

export const RUN_STATUSES = [
  "queued",
  "running",
  "finished",
  "failed",
] as const;

export type RunStatus = typeof RUN_STATUSES[number];

export type RunId = string;

export type ExperimentRun = {
  readonly id: RunId;
  readonly experimentId: ExperimentId;
  status: RunStatus;
  metrics: Record<string, number>;
  readonly startedAt: string;
  finishedAt?: string;
};

export type CreateRunInput = {
  id: RunId;
  experimentId: ExperimentId;
  status?: RunStatus;
  metrics?: Record<string, number>;
  startedAt?: string;
  finishedAt?: string;
};

这里用到了第 7.9 和 7.12 的内容：

export const RUN_STATUSES = [
  "queued",
  "running",
  "finished",
  "failed",
] as const;

export type RunStatus = typeof RUN_STATUSES[number];

含义：

运行时有 RUN_STATUSES 数组。
编译期自动得到 RunStatus 联合类型。
状态列表只维护一份。

得到的 RunStatus 等价于：

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

9. 第五步：定义 Dashboard 类型

文件：

src/labpilot-types/dashboard.ts

写入：

// src/labpilot-types/dashboard.ts

import type { RunStatus } from "./run.js";

export type RunStatusCounts = Record<RunStatus, number>;

export type RunDashboardData = {
  totalRuns: number;
  statusCounts: RunStatusCounts;
  finishedRuns: number;
  failedRuns: number;
  runningRuns: number;
  queuedRuns: number;
  hasFailedRun: boolean;
  bestAccuracy: number | null;
};

重点：

bestAccuracy: number | null;

为什么不是 0？

因为没有任何 accuracy 时，平均值或最佳值不存在。

0 是合法数值。
null 表示没有数据。

10. 第六步：定义 WorkspaceData

文件：

src/labpilot-types/workspace.ts

写入：

// src/labpilot-types/workspace.ts

import type { Project } from "./project.js";
