19. 最小可运行示例

创建文件：

New-Item src/object-types-demo.ts

在 package.json 添加：

{
  "scripts": {
    "demo:object-types": "tsx src/object-types-demo.ts"
  }
}

写入：

type Project = {
  readonly id: string;
  name: string;
  description?: string;
  readonly createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
  archivedAt: string | null;
};

type Paper = {
  readonly id: string;
  title: string;
  authors: string[];
  abstract?: string;
  citationCount: number;
  isRead: boolean;
};

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

type ExperimentRun = {
  readonly id: string;
  readonly experimentId: string;
  status: RunStatus;
  metrics: Record<string, number>;
  readonly startedAt: string;
  finishedAt?: string;
};

type RunDashboardData = {
  totalRuns: number;
  finishedRuns: number;
  failedRuns: number;
  runningRuns: number;
  hasFailedRun: boolean;
};

type CreateProjectInput = {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  description?: string;
};

function createProject(input: CreateProjectInput): Project {
  const now = new Date().toISOString();

  return {
    id: input.id,
    name: input.name,
    description: input.description,
    createdAt: now,
    updatedAt: now,
    archivedAt: null,
  };
}

function getProjectDescription(project: Project): string {
  return project.description ?? "No description";
}

function isProjectArchived(project: Project): boolean {
  return project.archivedAt !== null;
}

function renameProject(
  project: Project,
  nextName: string,
): Project {
  return {
    ...project,
    name: nextName,
    updatedAt: new Date().toISOString(),
  };
}

function createRunDashboardData(
  runs: readonly ExperimentRun[],
): RunDashboardData {
  const finishedRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
    return run.status === "finished";
  });

  const failedRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
    return run.status === "failed";
  });

  const runningRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
    return run.status === "running";
  });

  return {
    totalRuns: runs.length,
    finishedRuns: finishedRuns.length,
    failedRuns: failedRuns.length,
    runningRuns: runningRuns.length,
    hasFailedRun: failedRuns.length > 0,
  };
}

const project = createProject({
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
  description: "AI ResearchOps Platform",
});

const renamedProject = renameProject(project, "LabPilot v2");

const paper: Paper = {
  id: "paper_001",
  title: "A Survey on Efficient LLM Agents",
  authors: ["Alice", "Bob"],
  citationCount: 128,
  isRead: true,
};

const runs: ExperimentRun[] = [
  {
    id: "run_001",
    experimentId: "exp_001",
    status: "finished",
    metrics: {
      accuracy: 0.91,
      loss: 0.23,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
    finishedAt: "2026-06-25T10:30:00.000Z",
  },
  {
    id: "run_002",
    experimentId: "exp_001",
    status: "failed",
    metrics: {
      loss: 0.9,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T11:00:00.000Z",
  },
  {
    id: "run_003",
    experimentId: "exp_002",
    status: "running",
    metrics: {
      loss: 0.4,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T12:00:00.000Z",
  },
];

const dashboardData = createRunDashboardData(runs);

console.log("project:", project);
console.log("renamed project:", renamedProject);
console.log("description:", getProjectDescription(project));
console.log("is archived:", isProjectArchived(project));
console.log("paper:", paper.title);
console.log("dashboard:", dashboardData);

运行：

pnpm demo:object-types

你应该重点观察：

Project / Paper / ExperimentRun 都是对象类型。
description? 读取时要兜底。
archivedAt: string | null 需要判断。
metrics 用 Record<string, number>。
createProject 输入对象，返回 Project。
createRunDashboardData 输入 readonly ExperimentRun[]，返回 RunDashboardData。
renameProject 使用对象展开返回新对象。

20. 故意制造错误，观察 TypeScript 保护

20.1 缺少必需字段

const project: Project = {
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
};

如果 Project 要求：

createdAt: string;
updatedAt: string;
archivedAt: string | null;

就会报错。

修复：

const project: Project = {
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
  createdAt: "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
  updatedAt: "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
  archivedAt: null,
};

20.2 修改 readonly 字段

project.id = "proj_002"; // ❌

原因：

id 是 readonly。

修复方式：

不要修改 id。
如果业务真的需要新 id，创建新对象。

20.3 可选字段直接访问

function getDescriptionLength(project: Project): number {
  return project.description.length; // ❌
}

修复：

function getDescriptionLength(project: Project): number {
  return project.description?.length ?? 0;
}

20.4 nullable 字段直接当 string

function formatArchivedAt(project: Project): string {
  return project.archivedAt.toUpperCase(); // ❌
}

修复：

function formatArchivedAt(project: Project): string {
  if (project.archivedAt === null) {
    return "Not archived";
  }

  return project.archivedAt.toUpperCase();
}

20.5 动态 metric 直接使用

function formatAccuracy(run: ExperimentRun): string {
  return run.metrics.accuracy.toFixed(2); // 可能有问题
}

更安全：

function formatAccuracy(run: ExperimentRun): string {
  const accuracy = run.metrics.accuracy;

  if (accuracy === undefined) {
    return "No accuracy";
  }

  return accuracy.toFixed(2);
}

