22. 老项目 / 常见写法

22.1 对象用 any

const project: any = {
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
};

console.log(project.nmae);

字段写错不报错。

更好：

const project: Project = {
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
};

22.2 所有字段都写成 string

type Run = {
  id: string;
  status: string;
  accuracy: string;
  isFinished: string;
};

问题：

status 太宽。
accuracy 不适合计算。
isFinished 应该是 boolean。

更好：

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

type Run = {
  id: string;
  status: RunStatus;
  metrics: Record<string, number>;
};

22.3 用空字符串代替 null

type Project = {
  archivedAt: string;
};

const project: Project = {
  archivedAt: "",
};

问题：

空字符串语义不清楚。

更好：

type Project = {
  archivedAt: string | null;
};

22.4 多个 boolean 表达状态

type Run = {
  isQueued: boolean;
  isRunning: boolean;
  isFinished: boolean;
  isFailed: boolean;
};

问题：

多个状态可能同时为 true。

更好：

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

