22. 最小可运行示例

创建文件：

New-Item src/type-alias-demo.ts

在 package.json 添加：

{
  "scripts": {
    "demo:type-alias": "tsx src/type-alias-demo.ts"
  }
}

写入：

// src/type-alias-demo.ts

type ProjectId = string;
type ExperimentId = string;
type RunId = string;

type EntityBase = {
  readonly id: string;
  readonly createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
};

type Project = EntityBase & {
  name: string;
  description?: string;
  archivedAt: string | null;
};

type Paper = EntityBase & {
  title: string;
  authors: string[];
  abstract?: string;
  citationCount: number;
  isRead: boolean;
};

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

type ExperimentRun = {
  readonly id: RunId;
  readonly experimentId: ExperimentId;
  status: RunStatus;
  metrics: Record<string, number>;
  readonly startedAt: string;
  finishedAt?: string;
};

type RunDashboardData = {
  totalRuns: number;
  queuedRuns: number;
  runningRuns: number;
  finishedRuns: number;
  failedRuns: number;
  hasFailedRun: boolean;
};

type WorkspaceData = {
  projects: Project[];
  papers: Paper[];
  runs: ExperimentRun[];
};

type RunFilter = (run: ExperimentRun) => boolean;

type MetricFormatter = (value: number) => string;

type AsyncResult<T> =
  | {
      ok: true;
      data: T;
    }
  | {
      ok: false;
      errorMessage: string;
    };

const isFailedRun: RunFilter = (run) => {
  return run.status === "failed";
};

const formatAccuracy: MetricFormatter = (value) => {
  return `${(value * 100).toFixed(2)}%`;
};

function createRunDashboardData(
  runs: readonly ExperimentRun[],
): RunDashboardData {
  const queuedRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
    return run.status === "queued";
  });

  const runningRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
    return run.status === "running";
  });

  const finishedRuns = runs.filter((run) => {
    return run.status === "finished";
  });

  const failedRuns = runs.filter(isFailedRun);

  return {
    totalRuns: runs.length,
    queuedRuns: queuedRuns.length,
    runningRuns: runningRuns.length,
    finishedRuns: finishedRuns.length,
    failedRuns: failedRuns.length,
    hasFailedRun: failedRuns.length > 0,
  };
}

function renderProjectResult(
  result: AsyncResult<Project>,
): string {
  if (result.ok) {
    return `Project loaded: ${result.data.name}`;
  }

  return `Project failed: ${result.errorMessage}`;
}

const now = new Date().toISOString();

const project: Project = {
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
  description: "AI ResearchOps Platform",
  createdAt: now,
  updatedAt: now,
  archivedAt: null,
};

const runs: ExperimentRun[] = [
  {
    id: "run_001",
    experimentId: "exp_001",
    status: "finished",
    metrics: {
      accuracy: 0.91,
      loss: 0.23,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
    finishedAt: "2026-06-25T10:30:00.000Z",
  },
  {
    id: "run_002",
    experimentId: "exp_001",
    status: "failed",
    metrics: {
      loss: 0.9,
    },
    startedAt: "2026-06-25T11:00:00.000Z",
  },
];

const dashboardData = createRunDashboardData(runs);

const projectResult: AsyncResult<Project> = {
  ok: true,
  data: project,
};

console.log("dashboard:", dashboardData);
console.log("project result:", renderProjectResult(projectResult));
console.log("accuracy:", formatAccuracy(0.91));

运行：

pnpm demo:type-alias

你应该重点观察：

ProjectId / ExperimentId / RunId 是基础类型别名。
EntityBase 是公共对象字段。
Project 使用 EntityBase & {...} 组合。
RunStatus 是字面量联合类型。
RunFilter / MetricFormatter 是函数类型别名。
AsyncResult<T> 是判别联合。
createRunDashboardData 返回明确对象类型。

23. 故意制造错误，观察 TypeScript 保护

23.1 状态值拼错

const run: ExperimentRun = {
  id: "run_001",
  experimentId: "exp_001",
  status: "finish",
  metrics: {},
  startedAt: "2026-06-25T10:00:00.000Z",
};

报错原因：

"finish" 不属于 RunStatus。

修复：

status: "finished"

23.2 函数类型返回值错误

const badFormatter: MetricFormatter = (value) => {
  return value;
};

报错原因：

MetricFormatter 要求返回 string。
这里返回 number。

修复：

const goodFormatter: MetricFormatter = (value) => {
  return value.toFixed(2);
};

23.3 交叉类型缺公共字段

const project: Project = {
  name: "LabPilot",
  archivedAt: null,
};

报错原因：

Project = EntityBase & {...}
所以必须有 id / createdAt / updatedAt。

修复：

const project: Project = {
  id: "proj_001",
  name: "LabPilot",
  createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),
  updatedAt: new Date().toISOString(),
  archivedAt: null,
};

23.4 判别联合字段错误

const result: AsyncResult<Project> = {
  ok: true,
  errorMessage: "failed",
};

报错原因：

ok: true 分支必须有 data。
errorMessage 属于 ok: false 分支。

修复：

const result: AsyncResult<Project> = {
  ok: true,
  data: project,
};

或者：

const result: AsyncResult<Project> = {
  ok: false,
  errorMessage: "failed",
};

24. 当前工业界常用做法

场景
推荐
业务数据模型
type Project = {...}
ID 语义提示
type ProjectId = string
固定状态
type RunStatus = "queued" | ...
函数类型
type Formatter = (...) => ...
callback 类型
type OnRetry = (...) => void
公共字段组合
type Project = EntityBase & {...}
成功 / 失败结果
判别联合 type Result<T> = ...
加载状态
判别联合 LoadState<T>
跨文件导入
import type
运行时校验
类型守卫 / Zod，不靠 type

25. 老项目 / 常见写法

25.1 所有对象都匿名写

function renderProject(project: {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  description?: string;
}): string {
  return project.name;
}

问题：

重复。
难维护。
业务语义不明显。

更好：

type Project = {
  id: string;
  name: string;
  description?: string;
};

function renderProject(project: Project): string {
  return project.name;
}

25.2 状态用 string

type Run = {
  status: string;
};

更好：

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

25.3 成功失败结果用可选字段硬凑

type BadResult<T> = {
  ok: boolean;
  data?: T;
  errorMessage?: string;
};

问题：

ok true 时也可能没有 data。
ok false 时也可能没有 errorMessage。
data 和 errorMessage 可能同时存在。

更好：

type Result<T> =
  | {
      ok: true;
      data: T;
    }
  | {
      ok: false;
      errorMessage: string;
    };

25.4 用 as 假装校验

const project = JSON.parse(rawJson) as Project;

问题：

as 不做运行时校验。

更好：

const rawData: unknown = JSON.parse(rawJson);

// 类型守卫 / Zod 校验后再变成 Project

