一句话：

数据用 type。
能力用 interface。
状态用 type。
class 契约用 interface。

18. 最小可运行示例

创建文件：

New-Item src/interface-basic-demo.ts

在 package.json 添加：

{
  "scripts": {
    "demo:interface-basic": "tsx src/interface-basic-demo.ts"
  }
}

写入：

// src/interface-basic-demo.ts

type Project = {
  readonly id: string;
  name: string;
  description?: string;
  readonly createdAt: string;
  updatedAt: string;
  archivedAt: string | null;
};

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

type ExperimentRun = {
  readonly id: string;
  readonly experimentId: string;
  status: RunStatus;
  metrics: Record<string, number>;
  readonly startedAt: string;
  finishedAt?: string;
};

type AgentToolResult =
  | {
      status: "success";
      output: unknown;
    }
  | {
      status: "failed";
      errorMessage: string;
    };

interface Logger {
  info(message: string): void;
  warn(message: string): void;
  error(message: string): void;
}

interface ProjectRepository {
  findById(projectId: string): Promise<Project | null>;
  findAll(): Promise<Project[]>;
  save(project: Project): Promise<void>;
}

interface RunRepository {
  findById(runId: string): Promise<ExperimentRun | null>;
  listByExperimentId(experimentId: string): Promise<ExperimentRun[]>;
  save(run: ExperimentRun): Promise<void>;
}

interface AgentTool {
  readonly name: string;
  readonly description: string;
  execute(input: unknown): Promise<AgentToolResult>;
}

class ConsoleLogger implements Logger {
  info(message: string): void {
    console.log("[INFO]", message);
  }

  warn(message: string): void {
    console.warn("[WARN]", message);
  }

  error(message: string): void {
    console.error("[ERROR]", message);
  }
}

class InMemoryProjectRepository implements ProjectRepository {
  private readonly projects: Project[] = [];

  async findById(projectId: string): Promise<Project | null> {
    const project = this.projects.find((item) => {
      return item.id === projectId;
    });

    return project ?? null;
  }

  async findAll(): Promise<Project[]> {
    return [...this.projects];
  }

  async save(project: Project): Promise<void> {
    this.projects.push(project);
  }
}

class EchoAgentTool implements AgentTool {
  readonly name = "echo";

  readonly description = "Return input as output";

  async execute(input: unknown): Promise<AgentToolResult> {
    return {
      status: "success",
      output: input,
    };
  }
}

function createProject(
  id: string,
  name: string,
  description?: string,
): Project {
  const now = new Date().toISOString();

  return {
    id,
    name,
    description,
    createdAt: now,
    updatedAt: now,
    archivedAt: null,
  };
}

async function main(): Promise<void> {
  const logger = new ConsoleLogger();

  const repository = new InMemoryProjectRepository();

  const project = createProject(
    "proj_001",
    "LabPilot",
    "AI ResearchOps Platform",
  );

  await repository.save(project);

  const loadedProject = await repository.findById("proj_001");

  if (loadedProject === null) {
    logger.warn("Project not found");
  } else {
    logger.info(`Project loaded: ${loadedProject.name}`);
  }

  const tool = new EchoAgentTool();

  const toolResult = await tool.execute({
    message: "hello from LabPilot",
  });

  if (toolResult.status === "success") {
    logger.info(`Tool output: ${JSON.stringify(toolResult.output)}`);
  } else {
    logger.error(toolResult.errorMessage);
  }
}

main().catch((error: unknown) => {
  console.error(error);
});

运行：

pnpm demo:interface-basic

你应该重点观察：

Project / ExperimentRun / AgentToolResult 用 type。
Logger / ProjectRepository / RunRepository / AgentTool 用 interface。
ConsoleLogger implements Logger。
InMemoryProjectRepository implements ProjectRepository。
EchoAgentTool implements AgentTool。
业务函数依赖 interface，而不是依赖具体 class。

19. 故意制造错误，观察 TypeScript 保护

19.1 class 缺少接口方法

class BadLogger implements Logger {
  info(message: string): void {
    console.log(message);
  }

  warn(message: string): void {
    console.warn(message);
  }
}

会报错，因为缺少：

error(message: string): void

19.2 方法参数类型不匹配

接口：

interface Logger {
  info(message: string): void;
}

错误实现：

class BadLogger implements Logger {
  info(message: number): void {
    console.log(message);
  }
}

报错原因：

Logger 要求 info 接收 string。
BadLogger 的 info 接收 number。

19.3 方法返回值不匹配

接口：

interface ProjectRepository {
  findAll(): Promise<Project[]>;
}

错误实现：

class BadProjectRepository implements ProjectRepository {
  async findAll(): Promise<string[]> {
    return ["wrong"];
  }
}

报错原因：

接口要求 Promise<Project[]>。
实现返回 Promise<string[]>。

19.4 interface 不能直接定义联合类型

错误：

interface RunStatus = "queued" | "running"; // ❌

修复：

type RunStatus = "queued" | "running" | "finished" | "failed";

19.5 interface 声明合并导致字段变多

interface Project {
  id: string;
}

interface Project {
  name: string;
}

const project: Project = {
  id: "proj_001",
}; // ❌ 缺少 name

原因：

两个 Project interface 被合并了。
最终 Project 需要 id 和 name。

这就是为什么普通业务模型不建议随便重复声明 interface。

