更好：

function createRunDashboardData(
  runs: readonly ExperimentRun[],
): RunDashboardData {
  // ...
}

24.3 用 any 表达 callback

function filterRuns(runs: any[], predicate: any): any[] {
  return runs.filter(predicate);
}

问题：

run 的结构丢失。
predicate 返回什么都可能通过。

更好：

type RunPredicate = (run: ExperimentRun) => boolean;

function filterRuns(
  runs: readonly ExperimentRun[],
  predicate: RunPredicate,
): ExperimentRun[] {
  return runs.filter(predicate);
}

